    "body": "The gate on 92935735e (#3108 merge) has three FAIL rows, not one. Verified in the run log (45013742033): the ui-lib post-dialog test above, plus `blind_slot_pocket_family_cuts_from_end_wall_to_stock_edge` (app suite tests/blind_slot.rs, 4 s) and `adaptive2d_spiral_and_offset2d_support_relief_while_trochoidal_and_do_not_touch_refuse` (app suite tests/corner_relief_safety.rs, 5 s). The two app tests are new with #3108. The fix branch for this issue should cover all three. The gate on b6a3e7c6b (45013041231) has one FAIL row: the post-dialog test only.\n",
