    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T11:13:27Z",
    "body": "Cause of the post-dialog failure:\n\n- The merge of PR #3307 (887d8da2a) adds the Fanuc row \"Manual Guide i blank (G1902 / G1900)\" with a description line.\n- With this row, the Post dialog options are higher than the scroll area at a 900 px window (max height 0.78 of the window).\n- egui then shows its floating vertical scroll bar. The bar lies over the right edge of the content, where `check_row` puts the checkbox.\n- The click on the \"Write tool list\" checkbox (rect `[[551 514] - [569 532]]`) goes to the scroll bar, and the draft value stays `false`.\n- Proof: the same test passes at a 1400 px window (no scroll bar), with the same checkbox rect.\n\nThis is a product defect: a user also cannot click a checkbox below the scroll bar. Fix: the scroll content keeps a right gutter as wide as the scroll bar. The test keeps its 900 px window, and it now also pins the new `manualGuideBlank` row (listed, off by default, toggles, applies and undoes).\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
